{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q419065","formula":"C₂HF₅","hill":"C2HF5","elements":["H","C","F"],"composition":{"C":2.0,"F":5.0,"H":1.0},"names":{"en":"Pentafluoroethane","ru":"Пентафторэтан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Pentafluoroethane is a hydrofluorocarbon with the formula CF3CHF2. Pentafluoroethane is currently used as a refrigerant (known as R-125) and also used as a fire suppression agent in fire suppression systems. Pentafluoroethane does not deplete ozone so it has replaced earlier fluorinated chemicals that did.","ru":"Пентафторэтан (R125) — химическое соединение из класса фторуглеводородов с химической формулой C2HF5. Используется в качестве хладагента, а также используется для пожаротушения в системах пожаротушения. Пентафторэтан не разрушает озон, поэтому он заменил ранее фторированные химические вещества, которые это сделали."},"fame":18,"pubchemCid":9633,"mass":120.02,"charge":0,"smiles":"C(C(F)(F)F)(F)F","inchikey":"GTLACDSXYULKMZ-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1,1,1,2,2-pentafluoroethane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"9633","atoms":8,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.244,"y":1.092,"z":0.469,"el":"F"},{"x":-1.246,"y":-1.089,"z":0.474,"el":"F"},{"x":-0.684,"y":-0.004,"z":-1.335,"el":"F"},{"x":1.468,"y":-1.089,"z":-0.04,"el":"F"},{"x":1.468,"y":1.089,"z":-0.04,"el":"F"},{"x":-0.597,"y":0.0,"z":0.011,"el":"C"},{"x":0.835,"y":0.0,"z":0.46,"el":"C"},{"x":0.932,"y":0.0,"z":1.549,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,5,1],[1,5,1],[2,5,1],[3,6,1],[4,6,1],[5,6,1],[6,7,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q419065","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pentafluoroethane","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"http